      "content": "hey i'm working on this embedded c++ project for an automotive ECU and i'm seeing a slow memory leak. the ram usage just keeps climbing steadily until the system crashes after about 4 or 5 hours. i dont see any obvious new/delete calls that arent paired, but it's hard to track down in the real-time loop. can u give me a systematic way to find where the leak is happening?",
